  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Protect your home immediately by ensuring safety, covering exposed areas, and documenting all damage for insurance.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "Protect your home immediately by ensuring safety, covering exposed areas, and documenting all damage for insurance"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Immediate Safety and Assessment"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Turn off power: Cut electricity at the main breaker if you notice leaks or wet ceilings to avoid electrical hazards."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Inspect from the ground: Walk around your yard to look for missing shingles, bent gutters, or fallen branches. Do not climb onto a wet or damaged roof.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3,
              4,
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Check the interior: Look for water stains, dripping, or sagging drywall on top floors and in the attic. Place buckets under active leaks."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Prevent Further Damage"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Apply a temporary tarp: Cover holes or missing shingles with a heavy-duty waterproof tarp. Use the board-sandwich method by wrapping the tarp edge around a 2x4 board and screwing it into the roof decking.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              6,
              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Clear safe debris: Remove small branches or debris blocking gutters to allow proper drainage. Never attempt to move heavy limbs or debris off the roof yourself."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          8,
          9
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "For a visual guide on how to properly secure a temporary tarp using the board sandwich method:",
        "video": {
          "link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fb2z7NBDs90&t=43",
          "thumbnail": "https://serpapi.com/images/i/R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP_______yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw.gif"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Documentation and Insurance"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Take photos and videos: Capture clear images of roof damage, fallen debris, and interior water stains from multiple angles."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Save receipts\n: Keep receipts for any emergency repair materials, as these costs are often covered by insurance."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Contact your insurer: Report the damage promptly and review your policy deductible and coverage limits."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          10,
          11
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Professional Inspections"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Hire a local roofer: Schedule an assessment with a trusted local contractor to evaluate hidden structural or shingle damage."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Verify contractors\n: Avoid door-to-door \"storm chasers\" and independently check reviews and licensing to ensure quality work."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          12
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, let me know:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Is there active leaking\ninside your home right now?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Do you know if the damage is from wind, hail, or a fallen tree?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you prioritize your next steps."
      }
    ],
